{"id": "68822", "title": "唯一的小宇", "author": "折纸蚂蚁", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 42, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68822.htm", "intro": "世界上的有些人，命中注定要相纠缠一生\r\n他们一起开心、难过，他们即使分开，也会因为手指上的那根红线而回到彼此身边\r\n所以\r\n他说，我从来没有想过我们会分手，即使天各一方，你也会再回到我身边。\r\n\r\n\r\n他们曾是最令人羡慕的恋人\r\n可是命中注定有此一劫\r\n所以 命运的齿轮开始转动\r\n五年 是不是一切都已经不同？\r\n\r\n\r\n小文儿一篇 不虐 \r\n第一次写文 没有经验 不好的地方 请多多指教！！！\r\n各位如果看的开心些呢 就勉强收了它吧 \r\n多多留言 多多收藏吧", "base": "files/article/html/68/68822", "chapters": [{"title": "chapter 1", "file": "10547646.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 2", "file": "10547647.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 3", "file": "10547648.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 4", "file": "10547649.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 5", "file": "10547650.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 6", "file": "10547651.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 7", "file": "10547652.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 8", "file": "10547653.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 9", "file": "10547654.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 10", "file": "10547655.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 11", "file": "10547656.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 12", "file": "10547657.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 13", "file": "10547658.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 14（捉虫）", "file": "10547659.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 15", "file": "10547660.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 16", "file": "10547661.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 17", "file": "10547662.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 18", "file": "10547663.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 19", "file": "10547664.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 20", "file": "10547665.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 21", "file": "10547666.html", "available": false}, {"title": "chapter 22", "file": "1